intermittent|PASS: Pauses between rain episodes distinguish intermittent from continuous light rain; Vietnamese lúc có lúc không and intermittently guidance are natural.
nearby|PASS: Before-noun bakery adjective and stayed-nearby adverb distinguish constructions; contrast with near plus complement avoids nearby to as routine grammar.
